Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:35.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,能再繼續握一會手嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.13,0:21:36.86,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:45.29,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:52.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,早餐做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:54.93,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,好的！我就來！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,0)\c&H535354&\frz285.2\pos(1304,533)}{\3c&H000000&\3a&HFF&\4c&H000000&\4a&HFF&\c&H3D3C3F&\fn@Droid Sans Fallback}兩個人是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:08.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Summer！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:08.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1070,960)}夏日愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.59,0:22:12.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起艷陽高照吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.17,0:23:48.11,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴知道學校嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:49.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,當然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.25,0:23:52.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,從今天開始 我必須要去上學了...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:54.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 我陪你去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.48,0:23:56.49,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 小晴是進不去的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.66,0:23:58.03,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是... 是這樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:00.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:00.41,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.67,0:24:03.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,傳達心聲！小晴真情流露
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:53.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.49,0:01:59.08,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.29,0:02:04.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:12.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:17.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:21.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:23.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.23,0:02:27.53,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:32.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:34.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:38.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:42.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:46.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:46.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:48.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:53.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:58.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:03.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:08.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:11.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:19.29,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.91,0:22:29.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空萬里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:34.17,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能實現夢想與心願的蔚藍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.34,0:22:36.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開心中的麥克風
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:38.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,輕輕哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.76,0:22:41.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:44.06,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.06,0:22:46.02,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能與你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:48.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打開心靈+門扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.77,0:22:51.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已經激動到勢不可擋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:53.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.82,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.93,0:23:02.37,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}還是那條街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:08.20,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那裡 這便是奇蹟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:10.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的寶貝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.25,0:23:14.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都過來！傳開這韻律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.92,0:23:19.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牽起手 心連起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.17,0:23:25.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用溫暖的關懷 培育出的勇氣 是無窮無窮的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.35,0:23:29.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,積極的圖示是標記
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:33.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！這海闊天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.69,0:23:37.39,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們展開翅膀 飛向藍天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.39,0:23:38.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接起人與人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.78,0:23:41.49,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圓環！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
